"use strict";(self.webpackChunkbarcode_doc=self.webpackChunkbarcode_doc||[]).push([[760],{6e3(t,e,a){a.r(e),a.d(e,{_pageData:()=>n,default:()=>o});var r=a(641);const n=JSON.parse('{"path":"/print-barcode/features.html","title":"Features Spotlight","lang":"en-US","frontmatter":{},"git":{},"filePathRelative":"print-barcode/features.md"}'),s={name:"features.md"},o=(0,a(6262).A)(s,[["render",function(t,e,a,n,s,o){return(0,r.uX)(),(0,r.CE)("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[(0,r.Fv)('<h1 id="features-spotlight" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#features-spotlight"><span>Features Spotlight</span></a></h1><p>The WooCommerce Print Barcode Labels plugin comes with a wide range of features designed to scale your e-commerce and retail operations. Here is a breakdown of all core features.</p><hr><h2 id="_1-visual-drag-and-drop-label-creator" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_1-visual-drag-and-drop-label-creator"><span>1. Visual Drag-and-Drop Label Creator</span></a></h2><ul><li><strong>WYSIWYG Workspace:</strong> Design labels visually via a modern drag-and-drop React panel.</li><li><strong>Custom Layout Blocks:</strong> Add and arrange: <ul><li><strong>Product Details:</strong> Name, price, sale price, SKU, variable attributes.</li><li><strong>Order Details:</strong> Order ID, date, billing/shipping name, total items, totals.</li><li><strong>Barcode Elements:</strong> Configurable dimensions, barcode formats, and visibility toggles for human-readable text.</li><li><strong>Custom Text blocks:</strong> Add static notes, store terms, or branding.</li></ul></li><li><strong>Layout Sizing Controls:</strong> Set label height, width, margin, columns, rows, and page borders. Supporting custom dimensions for thermal labels, multi-label sheets, and A4 grids.</li></ul><hr><h2 id="_2-multi-format-barcode-engine" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_2-multi-format-barcode-engine"><span>2. Multi-Format Barcode Engine</span></a></h2><p>The plugin features a robust barcode generator supporting both standard 1D linear barcodes and 2D matrix barcodes:</p><table><thead><tr><th style="text-align:left;">Barcode Type</th><th style="text-align:left;">Format Standard</th><th style="text-align:left;">Primary Use Case</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>CODE128</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">1D High Density</td><td style="text-align:left;">General warehouse sorting &amp; alphanumeric strings</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>CODE39</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">1D Variable Length</td><td style="text-align:left;">Industrial applications &amp; legacy hardware scanners</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>EAN-13</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">1D Global Retail</td><td style="text-align:left;">Standard product retail tags (Europe/Asia)</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>UPC-A</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">1D Retail standard</td><td style="text-align:left;">Standard retail product labeling (North America)</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>ISBN</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">1D Book Standard</td><td style="text-align:left;">Publishing and bookstore inventory tracking</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>QR Code</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">2D Matrix</td><td style="text-align:left;">Mobile lookups, digital menus, coupon links</td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:left;"><strong>PDF417</strong></td><td style="text-align:left;">2D Stacked</td><td style="text-align:left;">Heavy data storage, logistics, shipping slips</td></tr></tbody></table><hr><h2 id="_3-print-server-hardware-automation" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_3-print-server-hardware-automation"><span>3. Print Server &amp; Hardware Automation</span></a></h2><ul><li><strong>Node-Based Print Daemon:</strong> Local server script runs in the background on your OS to manage WebSocket print commands.</li><li><strong>Zebra ZPL Command Translator:</strong> Converts designed canvas images directly into ZPL instructions for instant Zebra label prints.</li><li><strong>Image Mode Fallback:</strong> Print to any desktop laser, inkjet, or non-Zebra thermal printer via standard canvas-to-PNG printing.</li><li><strong>Auto-Print Hooks:</strong> Enable automatic prints upon e-commerce orders, printing baggage or product labels hands-free at checkouts.</li></ul><hr><h2 id="_4-bulk-admin-workflows" tabindex="-1"><a class="header-anchor" href="#_4-bulk-admin-workflows"><span>4. Bulk Admin Workflows</span></a></h2><ul><li><strong>Product Listing Integrations:</strong> Select multiple products in your WordPress catalog and trigger bulk barcode generation and PDF exports.</li><li><strong>Order Slip Prints:</strong> Select multiple orders to generate shipping slips or packaging barcodes in one click.</li><li><strong>Coupon Barcodes:</strong> Print barcode vouchers for WooCommerce discounts and hand them to customers in-store.</li></ul><blockquote><p>[!IMPORTANT] <strong>Barcode Scanner Compatibility:</strong> Most standard laser scanners require at least a <strong>0.25mm barcode bar width</strong> (X-dimension) to register scans reliably. Ensure your visual layout gives barcodes enough breathing room without compressing columns.</p></blockquote>',16)])])}]])}}]);